# reverse a string in place with Load/Store/Len
Text tau 0x10 "Tau++ rocks"
Len r0 0x10        # r0 = length
Set r1 0           # left
Set r2 r0
Sub r2 1           # right
swap:
Jge r1 r2 show
Load r3 0x10 r1
Load r4 0x10 r2
Store 0x10 r1 r4
Store 0x10 r2 r3
Add r1 1
Sub r2 1
Jump swap
show:
Print 0x10
Newline
